+
+## JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386)
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, applies a JSON Merge Patch and returns the
+merged document as a new value; the inputs are never mutated or aliased. A patch that is not an object
+replaces the target; an object patch merges member by member, `null` removing a member, nested objects
+merging recursively and arrays replacing wholesale. A non-object target is treated as `{}` when the patch
+is an object. It never throws.
